<body>
    <div class="container">

        <h1>Invitation – India International Travel Mart (IITM) 2025-26</h1>

        <p>Dear Mr. Mehaboob Khan & Mr. Sajesh Abraham,</p>

        <p>Greetings from IITM - India's Premier Travel & Tourism Show and South India's biggest and best travel
            exhibition.</p>

        <p>Hope you are doing well.</p>

        <p>We are pleased to invite you to participate in the forthcoming edition of the <b>India International Travel
                Mart (IITM) 2025-26</b>. The previous editions of IITM 2024-25 were a resounding success, making it one
            of the biggest tourism events in the country.</p>

        <p>IITM, established in 1998, is one of India's oldest and most productive Travel & Tourism exhibitions,
            showcasing hospitality, travel, and tourism products.</p>

        <div class="highlight">
            YOUR TRAVEL MARKETING STARTS HERE... RE-DEFINE YOUR BRAND, THE WAY YOU WANT!<br>
            Re-connect – Network – Succeed
        </div>

        <h2>Exhibitor Profile</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Tourism Boards - National & International</li>
            <li>Travel Agents & Tour Operators</li>
            <li>Hotels & Resorts</li>
            <li>Cruises & Airlines</li>
            <li>DMCs & Travel Technology Companies</li>
            <li>Rail & Transportation Companies</li>
            <li>Hospitality Institutions</li>
            <li>Adventure Sports & MICE Operators</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Visitor Profile</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Travel Agents & Tour Operators</li>
            <li>MICE Specialists & Event Managers</li>
            <li>Corporate Travel Decision Makers</li>
            <li>Hotel Professionals & Travel Media</li>
            <li>Travel Tech Professionals</li>
            <li>Holiday Makers / Direct Consumers</li>
        </ul>

        <p>Let us know your preferred stall size, and we’ll share pricing and availability.</p>

        <a class="cta" href="#">Book Your Space Today</a>

        <p><b>Stall spaces are limited and filling fast!</b> Secure your participation and connect with the travel
            industry across India and beyond.</p>

        <p>We look forward to your successful participation.</p>

        <p>For more details, contact: +91 9742942009</p>


    </div>


    <div
    style="max-width:700px;margin:auto;background:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #eee;padding:15px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#333;line-height:1.6;">

    <div style="font-weight:bold;">
        Sphere Travelmedia & Exhibitions Pvt. Ltd.,
    </div>

    <div>
        245, Amar Jyothi Layout, Domlur, Bangalore - 560 071. India.
    </div>

    <div>
        Office: 91 – 80 – 40834100
    </div>

    <div>
        Direct: 91-80-40834109 | Mob: 91 – 9742942009
    </div>

    <div>
        <a href="mailto:" style="color:#007bff;text-decoration:none;">
            
        </a>
        |
        <a href="http://www.iitmindia.com" style="color:#007bff;text-decoration:none;">
